  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p>Now comparing with,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></msup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Now using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msup></math></p></blockquote>",
